    "manifeste": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "h": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "A pillow can't be judged <b>by hand</b>.",
            "title_highlight_color": "#43789A",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In a shop you press it with your palm and decide in three seconds. That tells you nothing about what happens six hours later, once your neck has carried the weight of your head all night.</p><p>We start from the opposite end: the position you actually sleep in, and the height it demands. On your side, a gap stays open between your ear and the mattress. That gap can be measured. The shape follows from it, and so does the density.</p><p><strong>One question decides everything: does it hold you?</strong> If the answer is no, it doesn't join the range.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Our story",
            "button_link": "/pages/notre-histoire",
            "button_style_secondary": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "h",
        "t",
        "b"
      ],
