          "settings": {
            "title": "Three points carry the night: <b>neck, shoulder, hip</b>.",
            "title_highlight_color": "#43789A",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>On your side, your shoulder takes the weight of your torso and your hip sinks in. The pelvis tilts, the lower back compensates. That imbalance is what wakes you at three in the morning — not the noise.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
