    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Appui or Aplomb — which one?",
            "icon": "help",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Appui</strong> if you mostly sleep on your side: its contoured shape frees the shoulder and steadies the hip. <strong>Aplomb</strong> if you sleep on your back or keep changing position: its twin bolster fills the cervical hollow without lifting your head.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I wash it?",
            "icon": "local_laundry_service",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The cover comes off via the zip on the long side and goes in the machine at 30 °C on a delicate cycle. Air dry, no tumble dryer, no iron. The pillow itself is spot-cleaned.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it go flat?",
            "icon": "schedule",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Appui uses a high-resilience fibre designed to recover its volume after compression. Aplomb uses perforated memory foam. Neither is a cheap fill that packs down and stays down. A weekly shake keeps the loft.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if it isn't right for me?",
            "icon": "replay",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>You have 30 nights to try the pillows at home. An email is enough, no form. This commercial guarantee sits on top of your statutory rights — it does not replace them. In the EU that means your 14-day right of withdrawal and the 2-year legal guarantee of conformity.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/garantie-30-nuits\">Read the guarantee terms</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the strips a medical device?",
            "icon": "info",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No. They are comfort accessories with a purely mechanical effect. They do not treat, prevent or cure any condition — in particular not sleep apnoea. The contraindications are listed on every product page: read them before buying.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q1",
        "q2",
        "q3",
        "q4",
        "q5"
      ],
