    "difference": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes us different",
            "icon": "help",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Most pillows are designed to look good in a shop: thick, white, well plumped. Nobody sleeps like that. Every curve, every material here answers a single question: does it help you sleep?</p>"
          }
        },
        "d2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Built around how you actually sleep",
            "icon": "bedtime",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>On your side, on your back, or changing position three times a night. We start from real habits, not from categories printed on a box. Every product page says precisely who the pillow is for — and who it isn't for.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Every material earns its place",
            "icon": "check_circle",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Nothing goes into a product because it reads well on a label. The fabrics breathe, the fills hold their shape, the covers come off and go in the machine. If it doesn't improve the night, it doesn't go in.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
